# Acoustox — IoT Sump Health & Purification Dashboard

An industrial IoT telemetry dashboard and monitoring interface for CNC machine sump fluid health, tracking contamination levels, acoustic cavitation, and non-thermal plasma purification systems.

## ?? Monitored Parameters

- **Brix Concentration (%)**: Real-time refractometer fluid ratio.
- **pH Level**: Acidic vs alkaline fluid balance monitoring.
- **Tramp Oil (% volume)**: Surface hydrocarbon layer detection.
- **Bacterial Load (CFU/mL)**: Microbial bio-burden estimation.
- **Flow Rate & Temperature**: Coolant circulation status.
- **Acoustic Cavitation & Plasma Power**: Active transducer controls (PZT power, kHz frequency, plasma discharge).

